  "publishedAt": "2026-06-09T00:00:00Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/github-ci-hf-jobs",
  "sourceTitle": "Migrating Your GitHub CI to Hugging Face Jobs",
  "sourceBodyHash": "9748b5b4932698f166a607068507637f05f72033204a966c85bf5c29f2154b17",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:18:23.320618Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-15T12:23:54.870869Z",
  "totalBlocks": 86,
  "translatedBlocks": 86,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e402a31a483ab920",
      "translationZh": "如果你有一个 GitHub 仓库，并且启用了 GitHub Actions，那么你很可能在使用 GitHub 托管的运行器来执行 CI。这是许多项目的默认选择，因为它很简单：添加一个工作流，写上 runs-on: ubuntu-latest，GitHub 就会为你提供一台机器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eef8077aa82dceda",
      "translationZh": "这种默认选择很方便，但也有局限。GitHub Actions 可能运行缓慢，也可能因维护而停机；托管的机器都是通用配置，而 GPU 访问权限也不是大多数开源项目想开启就能开启的。对于 Trackio 来说，这些局限开始变得不容忽视。我们既想要可靠的 CPU CI 来执行基本单元测试和前端检查，也想要 GPU CI 来执行那些需要在真实 CUDA 硬件上运行的测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2f8a4681f60e8be",
      "translationZh": "于是，我们构建了一种替代方案：继续由 GitHub Actions 负责 CI，但将作业放到 Hugging Face Jobs 上运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0d8209395dbc98b",
      "translationZh": "结果是：Trackio 的 CI 现在运行在 Hugging Face Jobs 上，并以流式方式传回实时日志，将我们的 CPU 作业 CI 耗时缩短了约 30%，还让我们能够运行一整套全新的、在 GPU 机器上执行的测试！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0aee24b890036707",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将逐步说明如何为你的 GitHub 仓库搭建相同的配置。如果你正在使用智能体，可以让它参考本文，因为除了面向我们人类的基于浏览器的操作说明之外，我们还提供了 CLI 操作说明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2687f80febc23e0",
      "translationZh": "先来快速了解一下 Hugging Face Jobs 吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1c2fd02359c5aa5b",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Hugging Face Jobs？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1505acbb6ba68c11",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Jobs 让你能够在 Hugging Face 的无服务器基础设施上运行命令或脚本，并且几乎可以选择任何硬件规格。一个 Job 本质上是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c2afc34c10db1194",
      "translationZh": "要运行的命令",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ea06f7f3f481d4a",
      "translationZh": "来自 Docker Hub 或 Hugging Face Space 的 Docker 镜像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b84a9a1463165ad",
      "translationZh": "硬件规格，例如 CPU、t4-small 或 h200 GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "252cd97c3c23727b",
      "translationZh": "可选的环境变量和密钥",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a5eb1906910c6b7",
      "translationZh": "例如，你可以运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7175517a370b5cd2",
      "translationZh": "或者",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19e975c176fa05be",
      "translationZh": "这使得 Jobs 天然适合 CI。CI 作业本就由命令驱动，本就在干净的环境中运行，而且通常能从选择恰好合适的硬件中受益。对于机器学习库，GPU 场景尤其有吸引力：你可以在真实的 GPU 硬件上运行测试套件，而无需维护自己的常驻运行器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fc2c1b715afeceb",
      "translationZh": "关键步骤是将 GitHub Actions 连接到 HF Jobs，我们将在下文介绍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1fb54e20deaf0f53",
      "translationZh": "架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d8797f6fc62402a",
      "translationZh": "为实现这套配置，我们创建了 huggingface/jobs-actions，这是一个小型桥接工具，可将 GitHub Actions 作业转变为在 HF Job 内运行的临时自托管运行器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd2d5b6198a72a4f",
      "translationZh": "完整流程如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a7599bc79b36e058",
      "translationZh": "一个拉取请求触发 GitHub Actions 工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a6c497b83ecfda6",
      "translationZh": "GitHub 会将 runs-on 标签当前不可用的所有作业加入队列，例如 hf-jobs-cpu-upgrade 或 hf-jobs-t4-small，并通过 GitHub App 向调度器发送带签名的 workflow_job.queued webhook。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0901cb9408ffe04e",
      "translationZh": "调度器 Space 验证该 webhook，检查是否存在 hf-jobs-* 标签，生成一个短期有效的 GitHub 运行器注册令牌，并在匹配的硬件上启动一个 HF Job。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "88d8c5d40c151dba",
      "translationZh": "HF Job 启动一个临时 GitHub Actions 运行器，并使用该一次性令牌将其注册到代码仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "63009c80fd909706",
      "translationZh": "GitHub 将待处理的工作流作业分配给该运行器；运行器执行 CI 作业，将状态报告回 GitHub，然后退出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42623bdd4e5d5094",
      "translationZh": "从 GitHub 的角度看，这只是一个自托管运行器。从 Hugging Face 的角度看，这只是一个 Job：它启动一个容器，运行仓库中 GitHub Actions 的工作流步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5cd6056c2bcf7b1d",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：复制调度器 Space",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1869f1c0b2ae83c0",
      "translationZh": "你首先需要的是调度器。这是一个小型 Docker Space，用于接收 GitHub 的 workflow_job webhook 事件，并据此启动 HF Jobs。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5853ac463892d3b9",
      "translationZh": "请先创建它，因为 GitHub App 需要一个 webhook URL，而这个 URL 来自该 Space。这个 Space 应位于你自己的命名空间下，或位于你拥有写入权限的 Hugging Face 组织下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6e99f24c8483929b",
      "translationZh": "通过网页设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acab123ec6cea36d",
      "translationZh": "前往 huggingface/jobs-actions-dispatcher，然后点击 Duplicate this Space。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a33bd90ed15cb855",
      "translationZh": "使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01dfe0382a83884f",
      "translationZh": "在实际 CI 中使用 cpu-upgrade，以确保调度器始终可以接收 GitHub webhook。cpu-basic 用于测试没问题，而且很可能也能正常工作，但它可能会在闲置一段时间后进入休眠；如果 GitHub 的 webhook 在它正在唤醒时到达，工作流可能会一直处于排队状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fb0f8f5e1a7659e",
      "translationZh": "构建完成后，打开复制的 Space。你会看到一个标有“必需的 Space 密钥”的区域，目前可以先忽略它。首页应该会显示下一步所需的 GitHub App webhook URL。它看起来会像这样：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3fd73de8c0f7babf",
      "translationZh": "CLI 设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98e92c26a046e9c2",
      "translationZh": "如果你更希望通过智能体来设置调度器 Space，或使用 CLI 工作流：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3812b027b64927e6",
      "translationZh": "然后设置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "adfb61663c15c128",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：创建并安装 GitHub App",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "322f653431e27464",
      "translationZh": "接下来，直接从调度器 Space 中创建并安装 GitHub App。此 App 需要相应权限，以监听排队中的工作流作业，并创建临时自托管运行器的注册令牌。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6e99f24c8483929b",
      "translationZh": "网页端设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb134ebbe4f27f6a",
      "translationZh": "打开你复制的调度器 Space：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "251cd6c75b07a376",
      "translationZh": "在设置表单中，输入要在 HF Jobs 上运行 CI 的 GitHub 仓库：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f67873f05e63496f",
      "translationZh": "然后点击按钮创建 GitHub App。GitHub 会要求你为 App 选择一个名称；名称可以任意选择，只要它在你的 GitHub 账户或组织中尚未被占用。提交后，最后一个页面会明确说明如何使用 hf CLI 将 App 凭据上传到调度器 Space。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c516c63393f4e012",
      "translationZh": "重要提示：你需要提供一个具有启动 Jobs 权限的 Hugging Face 令牌，该令牌应对应你的个人账户或承担 Jobs 费用的组织。此令牌应保存为调度器 Space 中名为 HF_TOKEN 的密钥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e67444d9a67d3be9",
      "translationZh": "最后，将 App 安装到你在 Space 中输入的同一个 GitHub 仓库上。在 Trackio 的设置中，我们将其安装到了 gradio-app/trackio。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d4263fed11794f48",
      "translationZh": "智能体辅助设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "081bdda8352de3bf",
      "translationZh": "GitHub App 清单流程仍然基于浏览器，但智能体也可以按照同样由 Space 引导的路径操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20c593e25656afa3",
      "translationZh": "将 $GITHUB_REPO 粘贴到 Space 中，点击 GitHub App 创建按钮，选择任意一个尚未被占用的 App 名称，然后按照生成的 GitHub 说明操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95c0d551e312cf9c",
      "translationZh": "App 创建完成后，从 App 设置页面将其安装到你的仓库。对于 GitHub 组织，安装设置位于：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a8d1889cda920138",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：调度器的最终设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a732ce5adc9f75f",
      "translationZh": "此时，调度器 Space 应已配置完成。GitHub App 设置流程生成了将 App 凭据、webhook 密钥和 Hugging Face 令牌上传到该 Space 的命令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f63255160bd4414",
      "translationZh": "默认情况下，HF Jobs 会在与调度器 Space 相同的命名空间下启动。如果你希望将作业费用计入其他 Hugging Face 用户或组织的账户，可以选择将 HF_NAMESPACE 设置为 Space 变量：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d3d613c13e67634",
      "translationZh": "你在步骤 2 中设置的令牌应与此命名空间对应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e38a037476a77edb",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：更改 runs-on",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92dbf341371e7a13",
      "translationZh": "实际需要对工作流做的改动很小。不要使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebcd25eb2595ce3d",
      "translationZh": "而应使用调度器支持的标签之一：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "579a44b09ca9a51e",
      "translationZh": "对于 GPU 测试，请使用 GPU 标签：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea78f6ef4e664baf",
      "translationZh": "无论你想在 HF Jobs 上运行哪个 GitHub Action，都只需修改这 1 行！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dfa5b8c713f55bad",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5：测试一下",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aab905091e37a3dc",
      "translationZh": "要通过 CLI 添加一个最简冒烟测试工作流：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fa2cc944b53ab8f",
      "translationZh": "要通过 CLI 进行验证：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "376d2c1ee5c2f5c3",
      "translationZh": "你应该能像运行常规 GitHub Action 一样看到日志——例如这个 Trackio PR #565 中的日志。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c949b73ac45eb071",
      "translationZh": "这样就大功告成了！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa5fde3f3b11b8dc",
      "translationZh": "关于选择合适 Docker 镜像的说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02bf755d8cd7131f",
      "translationZh": "我们最初的 CPU 配置使用 ubuntu:22.04，并在每次运行时安装缺失的系统软件包。这种方式可行，但运行速度比本来可以达到的速度慢。GitHub 的 ubuntu-latest 镜像默认包含大量开发工具；而基础 Ubuntu 镜像并不包含这些工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "354e8a0354882a76",
      "translationZh": "对于 Trackio，UI 测试需要 Playwright 浏览器、Node、ffmpeg、sqlite、git，以及常规的 Linux 构建依赖。Hugging Face Jobs 支持使用任意 Docker 镜像，因此我们改用了 Microsoft Playwright 镜像，效果很好：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
